    {
      "title": "CloudFormation: Templates and Stacks Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "CloudFormation: Templates and Stacks Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Template vs Stack",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Template== (JSON/YAML) **declares** resources",
                "==Stack== = one deployed instance of a template",
                "Creates, updates, deletes resources **as a unit**"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Section",
                "Holds",
                "Required?"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`Parameters`",
                  "input values at deploy time",
                  "no"
                ],
                [
                  "`Mappings`",
                  "static lookup tables",
                  "no"
                ],
                [
                  "`Conditions`",
                  "if-logic for resources",
                  "no"
                ],
                [
                  "`Resources`",
                  "the AWS resources",
                  "{green:**yes**}"
                ],
                [
                  "`Outputs`",
                  "values to show or export",
                  "no"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Intrinsic Functions",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Function",
                "Returns"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`!Ref`",
                  "parameter value, or resource ID"
                ],
                [
                  "`!GetAtt`",
                  "a resource attribute (e.g. Arn)"
                ],
                [
                  "`!Sub`",
                  "string with `${}` substitution"
                ],
                [
                  "`!ImportValue`",
                  "another stack's export"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Declarative Ordering",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "State the ==desired end state==, not the steps",
                "Order comes from **Ref/GetAtt** dependencies",
                "`DependsOn` only for ==hidden== dependencies"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "Resources:",
                "  Bucket:",
                "    Type: AWS::S3::Bucket",
                "Outputs:",
                "  BucketArn:",
                "    Value: !GetAtt Bucket.Arn"
              ],
              "note": "minimal template: one bucket, one output"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "==Resources== is the **only** required section. Don't add `DependsOn` when a `!Ref` already links two resources."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "CloudFormation: Change Sets, Drift and Rollback",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "CloudFormation: Change Sets, Drift and Rollback",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Change Sets",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Change set== = preview of an update: what it will add, modify, remove",
                "Each change carries a ==Replacement== flag",
                "Review first, then `execute-change-set`"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Update Behaviors",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Behavior",
                "Effect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "No interruption",
                  "Updated in place, no downtime"
                ],
                [
                  "Some interruption",
                  "Brief outage, same resource"
                ],
                [
                  "{red:Replacement}",
                  "New physical resource, old one deleted"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Drift and Rollback",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Drift detection compares live resources with the template: ==IN_SYNC== or ==DRIFTED==",
                "It only **detects**, it never fixes",
                "{red:Failed create} → ==ROLLBACK_COMPLETE==: delete only, no update",
                "{green:Failed update} → rolls back to the last good state"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Protect Data",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Data guards",
              "items": [
                "`DeletionPolicy`: Retain or Snapshot",
                "`UpdateReplacePolicy` guards replaced resources",
                "Stack ==termination protection== blocks delete",
                "Nested stacks and exports split large stacks",
                "An export in use cannot be changed or deleted"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Replacement",
              "text": "Replacement **deletes** the old resource. Spot it in the change set before you execute."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "CDK: Constructs, Synth and Deploy",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "CDK: Constructs, Synth and Deploy",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Constructs and Levels",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "CDK defines infrastructure in ==code== (TypeScript, Python and others)",
                "Tree: {blue:App} contains {green:Stacks}, which contain {purple:Constructs}",
                "`cdk synth` turns the code into a ==CloudFormation template=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Code",
                    "sub": "App, Stack",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "synth",
                    "sub": "template in cdk.out",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "deploy",
                    "sub": "CloudFormation stack",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Level",
                "What it is",
                "Example"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "==L1==",
                  "`Cfn*` raw resource",
                  "`CfnBucket`"
                ],
                [
                  "==L2==",
                  "curated defaults, helpers",
                  "`bucket.grantRead(fn)`"
                ],
                [
                  "==L3==",
                  "pattern of several resources",
                  "load-balanced Fargate service"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Commands and Bootstrap",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Command",
                "Does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`cdk init`",
                  "new project"
                ],
                [
                  "`cdk synth`",
                  "emit template to `cdk.out`"
                ],
                [
                  "`cdk diff`",
                  "compare with deployed stack"
                ],
                [
                  "`cdk deploy`",
                  "create or update the stack"
                ],
                [
                  "`cdk destroy`",
                  "delete the stack"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`cdk bootstrap`: ==once per account/region==, creates the **CDKToolkit** stack",
                "It holds the asset bucket and deploy roles",
                "{red:Missing bootstrap} = the usual first deploy failure"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. CDK vs Raw CloudFormation",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "CDK adds ==loops, types and reuse==",
                "Result is still a stack: ==drift== and ==rollback== behave the same",
                "Unchanged logical ID keeps the resource"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Construct ID",
              "text": "Changing a construct ID changes the logical ID: the old resource is ==replaced==. Run `cdk diff` first."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
